msgid "模块与源码归属"
msgstr "Modules and source ownership"

msgid ""
"ReliefNT 按职责组织内核部件，具有独立注册和生命周期边界的部件可以通过 Kconfig 选择内置或编译为可加载 ELF "
"模块，默认保持内置。模块针对 ReliefNT 及其精确 ABI 身份编译，不直接加载 Linux 原版二进制模块。所有生产 C 和汇编 "
"文件独立编译，原版 Kbuild 管理复合模块和依赖。完整迁移、启动和运行验收仍在 进行中；交付范围与门槛见 "
"``Documentation/process/module-support-plan.rst``。"
msgstr ""
"ReliefNT organizes kernel components by responsibility. Components with "
"independent registration and lifecycle boundaries can be selected through "
"Kconfig as built-in or loadable ELF modules, with built-in remaining the "
"default. Modules are compiled for ReliefNT and its exact ABI identity; "
"upstream Linux binary modules are not loaded directly. All production C and "
"assembly files are compiled separately, and upstream Kbuild manages "
"composite modules and dependencies. Full migration, boot, and runtime "
"acceptance testing are still in progress; see "
"``Documentation/process/module-support-plan.rst`` for delivery scope and "
"acceptance gates."

msgid "目录边界"
msgstr "Directory boundaries"

msgid "路径：``arch/x86_64/boot/``; 职责：Multiboot2、入口与早期引导。"
msgstr ""
"Path: ``arch/x86_64/boot/``; responsibilities: Multiboot2, entry, and early "
"boot."

msgid "路径：``arch/x86_64/cpu/``; 职责：CPU 特性、GDT、SMP、任务切换汇编。"
msgstr ""
"Path: ``arch/x86_64/cpu/``; responsibilities: CPU features, GDT, SMP, and "
"task-switch assembly."

msgid "路径：``arch/x86_64/interrupt/``; 职责：IDT、IRQ、APIC 与 PCI 中断。"
msgstr ""
"Path: ``arch/x86_64/interrupt/``; responsibilities: IDT, IRQ, APIC, and PCI "
"interrupts."

msgid "路径：``arch/x86_64/mm/``、``platform/``; 职责：x86 页表、PCI、平台电源与平台接口。"
msgstr ""
"Paths: ``arch/x86_64/mm/``, ``platform/``; responsibilities: x86 page "
"tables, PCI, platform power, and platform interfaces."

msgid "路径：``kernel/init/``、``exec/``; 职责：内核初始化、版本和诊断；ELF 与用户地址空间装载。"
msgstr ""
"Paths: ``kernel/init/``, ``exec/``; responsibilities: kernel initialization,"
" versioning, and diagnostics; ELF and user address-space loading."

msgid "路径：``kernel/sched/``; 职责：任务表、EEVDF 公平调度、clone/exec、等待、会话、计时与统计。"
msgstr ""
"Path: ``kernel/sched/``; responsibilities: task table, EEVDF fair "
"scheduling, clone/exec, waiting, sessions, timing, and accounting."

msgid ""
"路径：``kernel/syscall/``; 职责：syscall "
"入口/分发；``fd/``、``io/``、``fs/``、``event/``、``device/``、``process/``、``ipc/``、``system/``、``memory/``、``time/``"
" 各自实现所属接口。"
msgstr ""
"Path: ``kernel/syscall/``; responsibilities: syscall entry/dispatch; "
"``fd/``, ``io/``, ``fs/``, ``event/``, ``device/``, ``process/``, ``ipc/``, "
"``system/``, ``memory/``, and ``time/`` each implement their respective "
"interfaces."

msgid ""
"路径：``kernel/{device,dma,module,signal,time,ipc,sync,random}/``; "
"职责：驱动注册和资源、DMA 物理缓冲、模块装卸与引用、信号、时钟/vDSO 数据、IPC、同步、随机源。"
msgstr ""
"Path: ``kernel/{device,dma,module,signal,time,ipc,sync,random}/``; "
"responsibilities: driver registration and resources, physical DMA buffers, "
"module loading/unloading and references, signals, clock/vDSO data, IPC, "
"synchronization, and random sources."

msgid "路径：``mm/{heap,physical,cache,user}/``; 职责：堆、物理页、页缓存、用户内存访问。"
msgstr ""
"Path: ``mm/{heap,physical,cache,user}/``; responsibilities: heap, physical "
"pages, page cache, and user-memory access."

msgid ""
"路径：``block/{core,partition,device,install}/``; 职责：块 I/O "
"与共享存储状态、分区/标识、设备链接、安装操作。"
msgstr ""
"Path: ``block/{core,partition,device,install}/``; responsibilities: block "
"I/O and shared storage state, partitions/identifiers, device links, and "
"installation operations."

msgid "路径：``fs/vfs/``、``security/``; 职责：路径/挂载、文件和目录操作、设备节点、权限与旁路元数据。"
msgstr ""
"Paths: ``fs/vfs/``, ``security/``; responsibilities: paths/mounts, file and "
"directory operations, device nodes, permissions, and sidecar metadata."

msgid ""
"路径：``fs/{ext2,ext4,ext_common,exfat,fat,iso9660,tmpfs,proc,sysfs}/``; "
"职责：文件系统注册与实现。``ext2/``、``ext4/`` 是分别带 owner 的注册入口，两者显式依赖 ``ext_common/`` "
"的实际分配、缓存、目录、extent、journal、格式化和挂载实现。隐藏的公共配置取两个入口所需的最高链接等级，避免内置代码引用外置实现。"
msgstr ""
"Path: ``fs/{ext2,ext4,ext_common,exfat,fat,iso9660,tmpfs,proc,sysfs}/``; "
"responsibilities: filesystem registration and implementation. ``ext2/`` and "
"``ext4/`` are registration entry points with separate owners, both "
"explicitly depending on the actual allocation, cache, directory, extent, "
"journal, formatting, and mount implementations in ``ext_common/``. The "
"hidden common configuration takes the highest linkage level required by "
"either entry point, preventing built-in code from referencing an external "
"implementation."

msgid ""
"路径：``net/{interface,link,ipv4,tcp,services,socket}/``; "
"职责：接口与配置、ARP/以太网、IP/UDP/ICMP、TCP 状态和收发、DHCP/DNS/NTP/HTTP、socket 生命周期和操作。"
msgstr ""
"Path: ``net/{interface,link,ipv4,tcp,services,socket}/``; responsibilities: "
"interfaces and configuration, ARP/Ethernet, IP/UDP/ICMP, TCP state and "
"receive/transmit, DHCP/DNS/NTP/HTTP, and socket lifecycle and operations."

msgid "路径：``drivers/console/``; 职责：文本控制台核心、绘制、ANSI、日志、VT 和 panic 输出。"
msgstr ""
"Path: ``drivers/console/``; responsibilities: text-console core, drawing, "
"ANSI, logging, VT, and panic output."

msgid "路径：``drivers/tty/{input,pty,serial}/``; 职责：输入路由、PTY/行规程/终端会话、串口。"
msgstr ""
"Path: ``drivers/tty/{input,pty,serial}/``; responsibilities: input routing, "
"PTY/line discipline/terminal sessions, and serial ports."

msgid ""
"路径：``drivers/video/framebuffer/``; 职责：像素/字形、绘图、呈现、VBE/VMware、启动图标与 panic 显示。"
msgstr ""
"Path: ``drivers/video/framebuffer/``; responsibilities: pixels/glyphs, "
"drawing, presentation, VBE/VMware, boot logo, and panic display."

msgid ""
"路径：``drivers/video/drm/vmwgfx/``; 职责：SVGA 资源/能力及 execbuf "
"验证、翻译、fence、retire、continuation。"
msgstr ""
"Path: ``drivers/video/drm/vmwgfx/``; responsibilities: SVGA "
"resources/capabilities and execbuf validation, translation, fence, retire, "
"and continuation."

msgid ""
"路径：``drivers/sound/hda/``; 职责：控制器 I/O、rings、恢复、verbs；codec 探测、路由和控制；stream "
"实现。"
msgstr ""
"Path: ``drivers/sound/hda/``; responsibilities: controller I/O, rings, "
"recovery, and verbs; codec probing, routing, and controls; stream "
"implementation."

msgid "路径：``drivers/{storage,net,input,usb}/``; 职责：按设备系列组织的硬件驱动。"
msgstr ""
"Path: ``drivers/{storage,net,input,usb}/``; responsibilities: hardware "
"drivers organized by device family."

msgid "路径：``sound/core/``; 职责：音频设备、PCM 状态/缓冲/格式/映射/传输、mixer、ALSA/OSS 接口。"
msgstr ""
"Path: ``sound/core/``; responsibilities: audio devices, PCM "
"state/buffers/formats/mappings/transfers, mixer, and ALSA/OSS interfaces."

msgid "路径：``lib/``、``firmware/``; 职责：内核内部基础工具、panic/bugcheck、文本与固件支持。"
msgstr ""
"Paths: ``lib/``, ``firmware/``; responsibilities: internal kernel utilities,"
" panic/bugcheck, text, and firmware support."

msgid "路径：``vdso/``; 职责：独立 vDSO ELF 及嵌入对象。"
msgstr ""
"Path: ``vdso/``; responsibilities: standalone vDSO ELF and embedded object."

msgid "私有接口与共享状态"
msgstr "Private interfaces and shared state"

msgid ""
"``include/uapi/`` 保持公开协议；``configs/header-export.list`` 是用户态头导出的 "
"唯一白名单。内核私有公共头位于 ``include/reliefnt/``，任务结构和访问器分别在 "
"``task/types.h``、``task/accessors.h``，不向 SDK 导出。"
msgstr ""
"``include/uapi/`` retains public protocols; ``configs/header-export.list`` "
"is the sole allowlist for userspace header export. Private common kernel "
"headers reside in ``include/reliefnt/``; task structures and accessors are "
"in ``task/types.h`` and ``task/accessors.h`` respectively and are not "
"exported to the SDK."

msgid ""
"一个模块内的跨文件声明放在本模块的 ``internal.h`` 或具体职责的私有头中。 "
"原先文件内共享的可变状态只有一个定义，其余文件通过私有声明访问；拆分不改变 调用方原有的锁、IRQ 状态、所有权或生命周期要求。跨文件可见性不构成用户 "
"ABI。 调度器共享任务状态仍由原调度锁和 CPU 所有权规则管理；网络、存储和显示代码也 "
"继续遵守原有执行上下文与锁顺序，不通过新增回调层改变调用顺序。"
msgstr ""
"Cross-file declarations within a module belong in that module's "
"``internal.h`` or a private header for a specific responsibility. Mutable "
"state previously shared within a file has only one definition, accessed by "
"other files through private declarations; splitting does not change callers'"
" existing locking, IRQ state, ownership, or lifecycle requirements. Cross-"
"file visibility does not constitute a user ABI. Shared scheduler task state "
"remains governed by the original scheduler locks and CPU ownership rules; "
"networking, storage, and display code also retain their execution-context "
"and lock-order rules, without new callback layers changing call order."

msgid ""
"``fs/fs_internal.h`` 保存文件系统族共享的磁盘类型与接口， ``block/core/storage_internal.h`` "
"保存块层共享接口；文件系统和块设备的 结构类型由私有存储类型头共享。协议结构布局及 exFAT upcase 数据保持原样。"
msgstr ""
"``fs/fs_internal.h`` holds disk types and interfaces shared by the "
"filesystem family; ``block/core/storage_internal.h`` holds shared block-"
"layer interfaces. Filesystem and block-device structure types are shared "
"through private storage-type headers. Protocol structure layouts and exFAT "
"upcase data remain unchanged."

msgid ""
"兼容 syscall 分发按原条件和顺序转交 ``legacy_*.c``；多个 ioctl 前缀的处理保留 "
"在同一处理函数内，保持原先允许继续匹配后续分支的行为。"
msgstr ""
"Compatibility syscall dispatch forwards to ``legacy_*.c`` under the original"
" conditions and in the original order; handling of multiple ioctl prefixes "
"remains in a single handler, preserving the behavior that allows matching to"
" continue into later branches."

msgid "本地 Kbuild"
msgstr "Local Kbuild"

msgid ""
"根 ``Kbuild`` 只列顶层子目录，并包含独立的产物规则。每个生产代码目录的 ``Kbuild`` "
"显式列出本目录对象及直接子目录，不通配扫描、不维护全局源码清单。 ``scripts/Makefile.module`` 提供共享的工具链身份依赖， "
"``scripts/Makefile.products`` 管理生成头、最终链接、调试载荷和 UAPI 导出。 导入的 Linux 6.12 "
"Kbuild/Kconfig 引擎保持原样。"
msgstr ""
"The root ``Kbuild`` lists only top-level subdirectories and includes "
"separate product rules. Each production-code directory's ``Kbuild`` "
"explicitly lists its own objects and direct subdirectories, without wildcard"
" scanning or a global source list. ``scripts/Makefile.module`` provides "
"shared toolchain-identity dependencies; ``scripts/Makefile.products`` "
"manages generated headers, final linking, debug payloads, and UAPI export. "
"The imported Linux 6.12 Kbuild/Kconfig engine remains unchanged."

msgid ""
"vDSO 使用其专用 PIC/链接参数，只有 ``vdso_blob.o`` 进入内核归档； 宿主工具使用 "
"``tools/host/Kbuild``；运行时宿主 fixture 由 ``tools/tests/Kbuild`` "
"一次构建，避免并行目标重复写共享对象。"
msgstr ""
"vDSO uses its dedicated PIC/linker flags, and only ``vdso_blob.o`` enters "
"the kernel archive; host tools use ``tools/host/Kbuild``. Runtime host "
"fixtures are built once through ``tools/tests/Kbuild``, preventing parallel "
"targets from writing shared objects repeatedly."

msgid ""
"产物路径保持为 ``O/generated/system/{kernel.sys,kernel.debug}``。 父仓继续通过原有 ``make "
"kernel``、``make image-vmdk`` 等目标集成。"
msgstr ""
"Product paths remain ``O/generated/system/{kernel.sys,kernel.debug}``. The "
"parent repository continues integration through existing targets such as "
"``make kernel`` and ``make image-vmdk``."

msgid "迁移追溯与检查"
msgstr "Migration traceability and checks"

msgid ""
"``configs/kernel-source-map.json`` 记录本次迁移基线及旧文件到新文件的对应关系， 仅用于历史审计，生产构建不读取它。旧"
" ``kernel/reliefnt/`` 实现与私有头目录已 移除；历史报告中的旧文件行号属于相应历史版本，应结合该映射查阅。"
msgstr ""
"``configs/kernel-source-map.json`` records this migration's baseline and "
"old-to-new file mapping for historical audit only; production builds do not "
"read it. The old ``kernel/reliefnt/`` implementation and private-header "
"directory have been removed; old file line numbers in historical reports "
"belong to their respective historical versions and should be consulted "
"together with this mapping."

msgid ""
"``make test-module-layout`` 检查各级本地 Kbuild、重复/遗漏对象、生产实现包含、 特殊 vDSO "
"源文件覆盖和上游引擎哈希。它也属于默认 ``make test``。 父仓 ``tools/test_build_incremental.py`` "
"从实际目录 Kbuild 读取预期归档顺序， 用隔离源码及输出验证源码/头/参数/工具身份和缺失产物的重建。"
msgstr ""
"``make test-module-layout`` checks local Kbuild files at every level, "
"duplicate/missing objects, inclusion of production implementations, coverage"
" of special vDSO source files, and upstream engine hashes. It is also part "
"of the default ``make test``. The parent repository's "
"``tools/test_build_incremental.py`` reads expected archive order from actual"
" directory Kbuild files and uses isolated sources and output to validate "
"rebuilds for source/header/flag/tool-identity changes and missing products."

msgid ""
"``tools/tests/modules/`` 仅供旧白盒宿主测试组合真实实现，不进入生产构建； 本仓 "
"``tools/kernel_test_sources.py`` 为这些测试定位实际源码，避免测试复制的旧实现。 ABI golden "
"和历史测试失败均应单独报告，不通过改期望值掩盖。"
msgstr ""
"``tools/tests/modules/`` is used only by older white-box host tests to "
"combine actual implementations and is excluded from production builds; this "
"repository's ``tools/kernel_test_sources.py`` locates actual source files "
"for those tests, avoiding copied old implementations. ABI golden failures "
"and historical test failures must be reported separately, without changing "
"expected values to conceal them."
